# Day 8 - Build Your First AI-Powered Dashboard

## Project Name
Personal Environmental Health Analyzer

## Overview
Today I used Claude Artifacts to build an interactive AI-powered dashboard.

The dashboard analyzes environmental health data including:

- Air Quality Index (AQI)
- PM2.5 Levels
- PM10 Levels
- City Environmental Rankings
- Health Impact Analysis
- Personalized Recommendations
- Environmental Report Cards

## Features

- Interactive dashboard UI
- Data visualization charts
- Environmental insights panel
- City comparison table
- Personalized recommendations
- Health impact assessment
- Mobile responsive design
- Modern dark theme interface

